OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cold and clear start to
OL,6,Fthe day for most areas. A fine day
OL,7,Ffollows with some reasonable sunny
OL,8,Fspells and temperatures recovering to
OL,9,Fnear normal. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,12,FRemaining cold overnight with frosts
OL,13,Flikely, fine by day but becoming
OL,14,Fcloudier while daytime temperatures
OL,15,Fremain near average through Sunday and
OL,16,FMonday. Strengthening winds and
OL,17,Fpotential for rain during Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
